EXAMINE VARIABLES=PM2.5_DailyMean PM10_DailyMean NO2_DailyMean SO2_DailyMean CO_DailyMean 
    O3_DailyMean BY Year
  /PLOT BOXPLOT
  /COMPARE GROUPS
  /PERCENTILES(5,10,25,50,75,90,95) HAVERAGE
  /STATISTICS DESCRIPTIVES
  /CINTERVAL 95
  /MISSING PAIRWISE
  /NOTOTAL.
